Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan\Nand his greatest challenge yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mama, lots of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sarah Fun, fun, fun, you so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.91,0:01:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss, Kick, kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss, kick, kill
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You in, Hamster Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we go kick the\NBeast Clan's ass together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you want me? You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.71,0:02:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind lending me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'd better show you\Nwhat I'm really made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him, my Hamster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Modified Bloodline++ star map.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.80,0:02:42.79,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0.3\shad0\fscx90\fs50\c&H8B85F2&\4c&H817DBA&\3c&H695CAC&\pos(19.5,15)}Modified Bloodline++: Star Map
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.03,0:02:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a map of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got my hammies to split up\Nand survey the area earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ought to come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't get lost\Nfinding the Beast Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.21,0:02:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think that's good?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.49,0:03:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till you see what I've got in\Nstore next Thank your lucky stars,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gator Here comes the\Nreal treat My secret talent
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I rarely break out for anyone\NMaking home-cooked meals
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thoughtful, but no thanks I don't\Neat food I haven't made myself Away,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my hammies Bring nuts, berries,\Nand anything else that looks edible
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.85,0:03:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on Modified bloodline plus-plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black hole!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.88,0:03:25.20,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord1.5\shad0\fscx90\fs45\c&HB9C1F8&\4c&H817DBA&\3c&H5141A5&\pos(330,17)}Modified Bloodline++\NBlack Hole
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Arashiyama special.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I present Anything Gruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I told you I can't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.23,0:03:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die without food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:04:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Hikaru, any food served to you\Nby another person will be poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you must never\Nlet your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.49,0:04:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the slightest lapse in\Njudgment will result in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you were serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.31,0:04:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama, that was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.53,0:04:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't worry about the dirt in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what it's worth, it\Nnever made me queasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.85,0:04:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My big brother went missing a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever we ran out of money,\Nhe used to whip me up a batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you do something special\Nwhen you're making it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.87,0:04:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No tricks, I copy his recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.05,0:05:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although if anything was\Ndifferent this time it might have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had something to do with me\Nthinking about you while making it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.73,0:05:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given your injuries I picked\Nout the healthiest nuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gave everything a nice subtle seasoning,\Nthen stewed it so it'd be easier to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.25,0:05:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So guess it was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I needed that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.45,0:05:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best food I think I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way those glasses\Nlook a lot like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they do it's a total coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, get a load of Prince Charming\Ncoming out here to face us all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for pain at the\Nhands of the koala masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My client has had a pretty eventful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needs to get her rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving us orders, even though\Nyou're outnumbered, Sevenfold?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really ought to be more\Nworried about yourself, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now witness the power bestowed upon\Nus by the Supreme Beastmaster, Beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, a little peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.97,0:06:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really like this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figured it'd be decent based\Non how you slopped it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.69,0:06:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's trash and I have\Nto rinse my mouth out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:07:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.43,0:07:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what I slopped down?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dating reality shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time when the main\Ncouple starts getting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,close some sleazebag butts in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the ones I root for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.07,0:07:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I went and offed your lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These glasses of hers, they\Nlook just like your specs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting to think one of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my pet sinking so low. Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.15,0:07:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I go too far? Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.13,0:07:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've caught me in a rare mood, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.51,0:07:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I found a new kind of blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little taste, I can't get enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.73,0:07:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stuff's mind-blowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I mention it's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.97,0:07:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last puzzle piece I need\Nto perfect cross-sanguination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The closer you get to dying, the more your\NYour modified bloodline comes to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.63,0:08:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shutting down any risky rejection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.99,0:08:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning it lets me marry bloodlines that\Nwould never mix otherwise risk-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdbrain managed to get\Na small sample, R .I .P.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So would you shut up already and\Nstart fighting for your life, Gato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.15,0:08:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your head in the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.69,0:08:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, I took your\Npotential bride-to-be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you don't want me to kill\Nyour lady friend, go and save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it? Feeling motivated? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Gato? Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening? Earth to Gato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet there's that murderous\Nrage I was waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you being a good sport!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That alone made the trip\Nworthwhile wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up or the hamster chick's going\NThe way of the dodo, and I ain't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.27,0:09:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All these guys, they're\Nfrom the Beast Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're from branch families just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.07,0:09:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd heard rumors about strange\Ndisappearances at association meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxin. Double dose.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.89,0:09:51.13,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord1\shad0\fscx90\fs55\c&H9898F1&\pos(570,5)\3c&H3A3794&}Toxin: Double Dose
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.99,0:09:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you needed was a little push!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:09:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.85,0:10:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what anyone else says.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.33,0:10:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of our whole generation of masters,?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're a prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the fodder I made\Nusing my cross-sanguination,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no match for natural selection.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.71,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fax-0.05\bord0\shad0\fs18\blur0.3\frz5.04\c&H291D0F&\move(215,220,309,220)\fry354}Biotechnology Lab
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.31,0:10:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.81,0:10:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what if you had to take\Non a hundred of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.21,0:10:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even an apex predator like\Nyourself ends up becoming prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, it doesn't\Ncome down to skill anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little further.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give up after coming this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could triple dose, but I'd probably\Nkill myself for good this time.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.21,0:10:57.61,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord1\shad0\fscx90\fs55\c&H9AC5E5&\pos(595,5)\3c&H4A6F95&}Toxin: Triple Dose
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.23,0:11:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Hikaru, it's imperative you never\Ntake risks that are beyond your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.85,0:11:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you're fit to inherit the Poison\NClan, an overdose will still kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must go accustomed\Nto toxins gradually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ask yourself how it would\Nlook if the future clan leader
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,died before achieving the\Nquintessence of The poison
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,master's art your purpose\Nin life should be to reach
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that impossible pinnacle To\Ntake the most lethal incurable
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,poison and survive an heir\Nto a main clan dying like
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.35,0:11:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this Pathetic sure I buffed\Nthem with cross sanguination
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.85,0:11:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they're small fries who\NOught to be ashamed to call
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,themselves masters and\Nthey've got him dead to rights
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more amateur work I see\Nyou haven't changed mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beastmaster I hope you're watching\Nyou know Instead of hiring
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred amateurs, you could have\Nentrusted your business to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.33,0:12:12.44,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fnGeorgia\fscx90\fs12\b1\c&H3D2E2A&\frz46.55\pos(271,173)}From plumbing to killing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.44,0:12:12.69,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur1.5\fnGeorgia\fscx90\fs12\b1\c&H3D2E2A&\frz92.01\pos(104,159.5)}From plumbing to killing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.69,0:12:15.73,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fnGeorgia\fscx90\fs12\b1\c&H3D2E2A&\frz69.19\pos(177.5,136)}From plumbing to killing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.73,0:12:16.99,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fnGeorgia\fscx90\fs7.5\b1\c&H3D2E2A&\frz62\move(104,66,104,84)\frx350\fry32}From plumbing to killing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cost-wise it'd be far more\Nefficient, don't you think, Mr. Gero?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.99,0:12:17.61,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fnGeorgia\fscx90\fs7.5\b1\c&H3D2E2A&\frz62\move(104,84,104,89)\frx350\fry32}From plumbing to killing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.61,0:12:18.07,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fnGeorgia\fscx90\fs7.5\b1\c&H3D2E2A&\frz62\move(104,89,104,92)\frx350\fry32}From plumbing to killing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.07,0:12:21.11,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fnGeorgia\fscx90\fs7.5\b1\c&H3D2E2A&\frz62\pos(104,92)\frx350\fry32}From plumbing to killing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.05,0:12:25.04,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,278)}Good-for{\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)}-Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.67,0:12:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get one thing straight\Nyou and I are not friends
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.65,0:12:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took a job offer from that\Nmarriage advisor of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured you could use some\Nbackup besides owing someone
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.43,0:12:35.55,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fs15\pos(527,197)\c&H4F4746&\3c&HCABFB9&}I hired her
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a debt isn't exactly good\Nfor business. You're here to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,help me so what embarrassing\Namount did you ask for on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this high risk job? 10,000\Nyen a day. 10,000? You're from
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of the great families an\Nindustry leader and here you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are driving down rates for\Nthe rest of us professionals
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:13:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's just perfect go hire an accountant
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.99,0:13:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because this couldn't be\Nany less cost effective
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting the Beast\NClan for the sake of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my cafe and to protect\Nany future customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.11,0:13:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why are you two willing\Nto go this far for that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you dead set on helping her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Personally, I'm just along for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.83,0:13:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as Gato can find a wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as he continues doing\Njobs for people who need him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.69,0:13:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll find the person he wants\Nto spend his life with, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.19,0:13:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the end goal is to get hitched,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like there's got to be\Nbetter ways of going about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, does it need to be so life or\Ndeath when there's matchmaking parties,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dating apps, and things like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that it's the most\Nefficient system for everyone out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for Gero, I think it's the\Nbest way for him to meet his match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save girls in a bind and\Nmake them fall for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.01,0:13:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll call it Operation White Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, he didn't think he could\Ndo the whole helping people approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.77,0:14:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as soon as he got started,\Nwell, even I was impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be sure, but I think deep down,\Npart of him wanted this all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using his abilities to give\Npeople their happy endings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or at least that's how it seems to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saying it all aloud, I believe Operation\NWhite Knight is the best approach for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he wants the most awesome marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's gotta find a partner\Nthe most awesome way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one knows their way around relationships\Nbetter than a marriage, Swindler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.57,0:14:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the Mitsubi Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear the Slothmasters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully nothing bad happens\Nbefore we can reach him Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If blood's gonna stain these\Nclaws, Hitman, I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the other masters\Nare attacking him as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.09,0:15:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close combat doesn't seem\Nlike his strongest suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't this be all for nothing if he ends\Nup dying before finding someone to marry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.81,0:15:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of hiring\Nmuscle in case things went south.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have quoted a\Nhigher estimate for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of them are particularly strong,\Nbut they excel in close-quarters combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The groundwater will run out\Nbefore their stamina does.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only fight while\Nconserving water for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water Master, lend me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.95,0:15:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't work for you, so I\Ndon't have to take orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.11,0:15:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes the poison jab!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody clear out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maintain visual on the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.11,0:15:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine if we keep our distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:15:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should disperse in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.65,0:16:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We already knew he would counter\Nwith this sort of attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.51,0:16:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poison is forcing\Nits way into our lungs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously mist is one of my tools,\Nbut don't make unreasonable demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.99,0:16:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commanding me to use it to control\Nyour poison is crossing the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expect advance notice\Nbefore future joint ventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time is money, so let's pick up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.49,0:17:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Water Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were a lifesaver back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a fun surprise, I called in\Na cutie who's tough as nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.01,0:17:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of them should have met up by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Miss Arashiyama here,\Nwon't that cause problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must keep my mind clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Abandon all hope, ye who enter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Accepting your fate is the\Nonly way to die peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the test subject they\Nlocked in beside me won't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's already at death's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I stay quiet and do as I'm\Ntold, I can avoid any more suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One has to justly let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.41,0:17:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either you keep your\Nsanity and die like a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or go insane and perish like an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:18:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they imprison you here, that's\Nthe one freedom you have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman's got three days to live, Tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only have a few hours left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty low, sending children\Nto spy on our network.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.41,0:18:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have known better, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.21,0:18:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adults can be cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't have some rat girl sticking\Nher whiskers in our operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call this Senzo Hashoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little pill not only cleanses your\Ninsides, it gives you a killer high.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real two-birds-one-stone-wonder drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your organs belong to us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.97,0:18:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After my brother disappeared, I\Nknew I couldn't turn down the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.19,0:18:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready to die yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd turned the association\Ndown even when they insisted!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, even more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.27,0:19:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd never been\Nborn a master at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you find our hideout?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.91,0:19:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You left us no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to perforate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.97,0:19:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the Guardians of Order!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.65,0:19:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they hire one\Nof the five families?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not how the game is played!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.19,0:19:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just did the job I was told to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.78,0:20:11.00,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\bord1\shad0\blur0.3\fs18\b1\fnImpact\3c&H8B5A62&\c&HE3E5EA&\pos(270,246)\frz22}Gero
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.53,0:20:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that moment, I made a vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since he was my knight in shining armor,\NI'd be his number one fan for life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.47,0:20:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But deep down, I knew the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In those days, Gero was\Nall kinds of messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was just some jerk who\Nonly saw what I wanted to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then he reached out and helped me\Nagain. Not because someone told him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.45,0:20:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had to like before this time he wanted\Nto he matured into an amazing person
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well here I am still being useless you in
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hamster master I say we\Ngo kick the beast clans
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ass together I have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be a beast I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:21:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give it everything I have.\NI refuse to let him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.41,0:21:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ratty rat rat rat rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.51,0:21:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ratty rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you hammies and ratties get\Nin position around the cages!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.13,0:21:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.93,0:21:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Modified Bloodline++?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.07,0:21:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hammy Rat Network is online!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.03,0:21:46.22,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord1.5\shad0\fscx90\fs45\c&HB9C1F8&\4c&H817DBA&\3c&H5141A5&\pos(330,17)}Modified Bloodline++\NHammy-Rat Network
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.81,0:21:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Kimi Arashiyama,\Nthe Hamster Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.49,0:21:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.49,0:21:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We bust out of this joint!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.79,0:22:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be creepy. Oh, say that boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be creepy, oh, say that boys
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.29,0:22:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be creepy. Oh, make a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.43,0:22:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be creepy. Oh, make a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.77,0:23:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.75,0:23:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see what I'm talking about.\NThe problem is that I'm looking at
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.45,0:23:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to feel the growth of my growth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.45,0:23:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm dying. I\Nlove you, baby. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.19,0:23:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,baby
